ent/2605ee21-9d5f-468a-a665-7bf69de0ce0e/SADPD_Main_Mods_Version_Tracked_Changes_FINAL.pdf","confidence_pct":100},{"id":"L3-10","assertion":"The Site 3 policy indicates potential for approximately 25 to 30 self-contained residential units.","source":"https://haveyoursay.lambeth.gov.uk/uploads/f43a1bbd-d83a-47db-99cb-525df665d771/files/file/content/2605ee21-9d5f-468a-a665-7bf69de0ce0e/SADPD_Main_Mods_Version_Tracked_Changes_FINAL.pdf","confidence_pct":100},{"id":"L3-11","assertion":"MM48 revises Site 3 heritage wording to preserve or enhance the significance, including setting, of heritage assets.","source":"https://www.lambeth.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2026-04/Annex%201%20-%20Schedule%20of%20Main%20Modifications%20-%202026_0.pdf","confidence_pct":100},{"id":"L3-12","assertion":"MM49 says Site 3 is not appropriate for a tall building, defined as above 25 metres in this location.","source":"https://www.lambeth.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2026-04/Annex%201%20-%20Schedule%20of%20Main%20Modifications%20-%202026_0.pdf","confidence_pct":100},{"id":"L3-13","assertion":"MM49 also requires redevelopment to respond appropriately to the height of buildings across the road and reinforce town-centre character.","source":"https://www.lambeth.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2026-04/Annex%201%20-%20Schedule%20of%20Main%20Modifications%20-%202026_0.pdf","confidence_pct":100},{"id":"L3-14","assertion":"MM50 expects Site 3 development to be car-free with vehicle access restricted to disabled persons' parking and servicing.","source":"https://www.lambeth.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2026-04/Annex%201%20-%20Schedule%20of%20Main%20Modifications%20-%202026_0.pdf","confidence_pct":100},{"id":"L3-15","assertion":"MM51 requires development to address existing open-space and access-to-nature deficiency through Local Plan Policy EN1(d).","source":"https://www.lambeth.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2026-04/Annex%201%20-%20Schedule%20of%20Main%20Modifications%20-%202026_0.pdf","confidence_pct":100},{"id":"L